# Generated PDFs are committed on release, drafts are not
*.draft.pdf

# NOTE: docs/figures/*.png, analysis/NUMBERS.md, and analysis/numbers.json ARE
# committed on purpose. They are generated by analysis/compute_model.py, and
# committing them means a reader can see the numbers without running Python.
# If you change the model, regenerate and commit them in the same commit.
